Both individuals asked not to be identified publicly. For that reason, I have limited identifying information in this statement where appropriate.

I am a former member of the group known as Circle Fuckz, Rage's Hideout, and The Kingdom. The group now refers to itself as the "Family" and, to the best of my knowledge, currently operates through a public Discord server known as Jhin Cate Cafe.

I joined the group in approximately December 2013. When I first joined, they were nice, welcoming, and always stood up to people they referred to as "Siters" or "CFs." I stayed with them because I never had what I felt was a true group of friends or a family, and they provided that for me.
At the time, I never noticed any red flags or inappropriate content. The only images I remember seeing were normal selfies, photo edits, and AMVs. We also spent time video chatting and talking together, and they were enjoyable to be around. When I first joined, I genuinely felt like they were my family and that it was safe to be myself.
I made many friends who were around my age, as well as some who were older. I also became attached to Patrice, who used the names Melvin, Christopher ("Chris"), Bluey, and Salvation. At the time, they meant a great deal to me. Looking back now, I believe I was groomed into believing that Patrice was never in the wrong.
By 2015, I had moved into my own place and was slowly adjusting to living alone. Around that time, I also began distancing myself from the group. As time went on, I completely left and began to realize what had been happening to many of us. I came to believe that Patrice, who I believe was in their early to mid-20s at the time, was grooming and engaging in romantic relationships with multiple minors.
After leaving, I joined another online group. Although that group was not healthy for me and I experienced mental and verbal abuse there, I am not aware of any criminal activity occurring within that group.
We decided to start telling others what had been happening within the "Family." After I began speaking about my experiences, the Family became aware of it and started harassing me through multiple online accounts. I believed these accounts were connected to the Family because they referred to Patrice by names such as Melvin, Chris, and their other known aliases, and they repeated information that had only been shared within the group. They also encouraged members of their following to harass me.
By early 2016, they had begun taking photographs from my Facebook, Instagram, and other social media accounts. They repeatedly harassed me online, used my legal name, shared my home address without my permission, and threatened my life. As a result, I became frightened.
After things had quieted down, several people I knew personally joined the new group I had become part of. Unfortunately, they began sharing my personal information with the Family, and someone connected to the Family also joined that group. Once this happened, the harassment began again.
As a result, I chose to keep to myself and only used my personal account that was connected to my biological family. Fortunately, they never contacted my offline family, but they did contact several of my online friends. Because of this, I no longer communicate with some of those friends.
mid 2016 i decided to go back it felt at the time a safer option to be their and apart of them then be an outsider and get attacked by the family in general as they were threatening to have people come to my home to hurt me, so i re-joined after apologizing i made new accounts on every end of my online life and changed my name, while also searching for a better place to be where they could not find me easily, at then end of 2016 going into 2017 they started posting adult photos publicly on Twitter now X and on Google Plus now discontinued, they also sent it in the private group chat (Blue’z Kingdom)....some of the photos where of Kyle Dick being hard or flaccid, another was of them having sex and the third was patrice being shirtless with her boobs out and or showing their butt plug off while it was inserted in their anus, I did not feel too good as Minor 1 remembers seeing Patrice post a edited photo of her with a blue cock, Minor 2 was openly dating them and mentioned it a few times through out the time i was with them, by 2017 they had someone who had just turned 18 move in with them to be their partner and was also treating them terribly….the biggest moment was when Patrice whipped and beat both Kyle and the Victim, they then posted photos of the beating and even made a very large statement of what happens when someone betrays or hurt Patrice, immediately the next day the Victim had gone to the officers and then arrested patrice but then let patrice go because they looked “unable” to cause harm to the victim, once that happened i got into a relationship which stopped me from being online and active.


During the physical abuse, grooming, and everything else that happened, I believed it was normal. As I grew older, I realized that it was not, and I began to feel disgusted with myself. Looking back, I believe I had been groomed into accepting that this behavior was normal, and that realization was extremely difficult for me.
I cried for the victim and often wished they were okay. I wanted to reach out and apologize for never speaking up, but I never felt safe enough to do so. I hated myself for everything I had witnessed and for not feeling able to tell anyone at the time.
My relationship ended in 2018, and I did not rejoin the Family. After some time, I began thinking about the people I was close to and had left behind. I decided to return in the hope of helping them leave the Family, so I rejoined the group.
I remained cordial, but every time they made racist comments, shared nude photographs, or discussed sexual topics, I felt uncomfortable and sick to my stomach. I decided to take action and worked with two people I knew well, M and O. I spoke with M first, and after hearing my concerns, they also began recognizing the abuse they were experiencing from Patrice and Kyle. M told me they would not leave without O, so I spoke with O as well. O agreed with M's decision, and while they slowly distanced themselves from the Family, I began speaking with Minor 1 and Minor 2.
Minor 1 ("C") was aware of everything that had been happening. They had attempted to take their own life and told me it was because of Patrice's treatment of them. They were frightened and did not want to completely leave Patrice, so I helped them through the process slowly and carefully. Years later, I asked C about Patrice again, but they never wanted to talk about them. The memories were still so painful that they vomited. Despite this, C was later able to make a public post with me about what had happened. Out of respect for C's privacy, I have chosen to keep their identity anonymous in this statement.
I contacted Minor 2 ("T") through Instagram. They had not been around enough to fully see the issues, so I showed them examples of Patrice's behavior and the way they treated and spoke to people. After seeing this, Minor 2 decided to leave the Family. During the time I knew them, they were also in a relationship with Patrice under another name.
After helping everyone I could, I tried to help one other person, whom I will refer to as F. From my observations, F was heavily influenced by the Family and remained loyal to them despite the behavior I had witnessed, including grooming, sharing sexually explicit material around minors, threats, and other inappropriate conduct.
I was unable to convince F to leave. I remain concerned for the new people joining the group. Other former members have also described the group's behavior as grooming, pedophilic, and cult-like. Based on my own experiences, I share those concerns.
I still remember the threats that were made against me, and I still have screenshots and images documenting many of them. Although I try to move forward and put these experiences behind me, I remember a great deal of what happened, and some days those memories are difficult to deal with.
My hope is that the people who were harmed receive the justice they deserve and that Patrice and Kyle are held accountable for their actions.
I am willing to provide the screenshots, images, and any other evidence I still possess if requested.
